  "bodyHash": "6e948731ca801655",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_81f8990e-6de2-4223-9b21-e1bf22d503fe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"472\"></p>\n<p>這個模組剛剛推出了與 TerraFirmaGreg 相容的版本！歡迎前往這裡查看：<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-of-terrafirmagreg\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights of TerraFirmaGreg&nbsp;</a></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_2ced21a1-0607-42c4-bfeb-9346947b31c6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"62\"></p>\n<p>本模組旨在盡可能讓 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Shields, Armor and Weapons</a></strong>&nbsp;及其擴充內容與 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrafirmacraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraFirmaCraft</a></strong>&nbsp;相容。自版本 <strong>3.0</strong> 起，<strong>Epic Knights of TerraFirma</strong>&nbsp;包含了 <strong><em>900+</em></strong>&nbsp;種物品，涵蓋 <em>武器</em>、<em>盾牌</em>&nbsp;與 <em>盔甲</em>，且使用了 <strong>TFC</strong>&nbsp;生存模式中所有可用的材質。來自 <strong>Epic Knights</strong>&nbsp;與 <strong>Epic Knights: Antique Legacy</strong>&nbsp;的資源已重新設計以符合 <strong>TFC</strong>&nbsp;的美術風格，對應的物品數值也經過調整以契合 <strong>TFC</strong>&nbsp;的遊戲玩法。護甲屬性可透過設定檔進行自訂！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_975b12a1-f75e-40a4-8214-974698f1d3b4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"62\"></p>\n<p>自版本 <strong>3.0</strong> 起，<strong>Epic Knights of TerraFirma</strong>&nbsp;模組已預設支援 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></strong>&nbsp;，預計不會與其他模組產生衝突或問題。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_e0572cef-4c09-4f4d-b7a4-ff41983b0d5b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"66\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_274c52a1-3723-4435-b7c3-f21bb3ef0624.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"942\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_4fbbf070-ada0-4680-abbb-d890cb756057.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"65\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_c578c568-bb70-4f76-a01e-5bec8db26ff6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"710\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_16e51fed-094c-4478-b404-8d75e530a1e8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"67\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_5d77e783-308e-4640-ba39-446abb87407a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"260\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_32b0f980-0c3b-4ad4-946e-fc8787c94b3e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"571\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_3531e109-b66f-441c-a432-f631c79af3de.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"66\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_70c95701-bf7a-4465-8839-c804588652fa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"436\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_7ed83493-8ecd-43be-a973-aa0971ffe128.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"65\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_c2005522-0356-477d-961c-b8d23aede9e1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"712\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_b5637dd0-782e-4a25-b383-bf4141bd9adc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"476\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_bd8c0bcd-6573-493b-a6f4-76cf15ef5891.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"335\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_0434a30e-7e4f-49b6-8b9e-adbcbb28eb61.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"65\"></p>\n<p>目前的開發路線圖如下，哈哈：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>新增對 Epic Knights 擴充模組的支援</li>\n</ul>\n<p>不過，這在近期內應該不會實現。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_a1ededac-9c40-4f41-9faf-76c51167c006.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"65\"></p>\n<p>我要衷心感謝 <strong>Magistu</strong>&nbsp;願意隨時解答關於他模組內部運作的各種問題；感謝 <strong>SomeIdiot13</strong>&nbsp;（目前的 Discord 暱稱）協助除錯與測試我的模組；感謝 <strong>StaxiHD</strong>&nbsp;協助處理貼圖與德文翻譯；以及感謝 <strong>MrHiTech</strong>&nbsp;創造了如此精彩的資料包，最終演變成本模組。此外還要特別感謝 <strong>Yappit1</strong>、<strong>Seagullible</strong> 與 <strong>sossololpipi</strong>&nbsp;在遊玩 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/terrafirmacultures-s2\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraFirmaCultures</a> 時協助測試與除錯我的模組。</p>",
